              "如果目标是做一个**美股大市值科技核心池**，你的列表已经覆盖很多，但还有不少可以补充。我会偏向**市值较大、行业地位明确、长期有机构资金配置的公司**。\n\n## AI / 云计算 / 软件\n\n- urlSalesforce (CRM)https://www.salesforce.com（如果之前 WORK 的逻辑保留，其母公司就是它）\n- urlServiceNow (NOW)https://www.servicenow.com\n- urlAdobe (ADBE)https://www.adobe.com\n- urlIntuit (INTU)https://www.intuit.com\n- urlWorkday (WDAY)https://www.workday.com\n- urlAtlassian (TEAM)https://www.atlassian.com\n- urlDatadog (DDOG)https://www.datadoghq.com\n- urlCrowdStrike (CRWD)https://www.crowdstrike.com\n- urlPalo Alto Networks (PANW)https://www.paloaltonetworks.com\n- urlFortinet (FTNT)https://www.fortinet.com\n- urlZscaler (ZS)https://www.zscaler.com\n- urlCloudflare (NET)https://www.cloudflare.com\n\n---\n\n## 半导体 / AI 硬件\n\n- urlNVIDIA (NVDA)https://www.nvidia.com\n- urlBroadcom (AVGO)https://www.broadcom.com\n- urlAdvanced Micro Devices (AMD)https://www.amd.com\n- urlQualcomm (QCOM)https://www.qualcomm.com\n- urlTexas Instruments (TXN)https://www.ti.com\n- urlAnalog Devices (ADI)https://www.analog.com\n- urlMicrochip Technology (MCHP)https://www.microchip.com\n- urlKLA (KLAC)https://www.kla.com\n- urlApplied Materials (AMAT)https://www.appliedmaterials.com\n- urlLam Research (LRCX)https://www.lamresearch.com\n- urlMicron Technology (MU)https://www.micron.com\n- urlMarvell Technology (MRVL)https://www.marvell.com\n\n---\n\n## 互联网平台\n\n- urlAlphabet (GOOGL)https://www.abc.xyz\n- urlAmazon (AMZN)https://www.amazon.com\n- urlMeta Platforms (META)https://www.meta.com\n- urlNetflix (NFLX)https://www.netflix.com\n- urlUber (UBER)https://www.uber.com\n- urlAirbnb (ABNB)https://www.airbnb.com\n- urlBooking Holdings (BKNG)https://www.bookingholdings.com\n\n---\n\n## 硬件 / 消费电子\n\n- urlApple (AAPL)https://www.apple.com\n- urlDell Technologies (DELL)https://www.dell.com\n- urlHewlett Packard Enterprise (HPE)https://www.hpe.com\n- urlHP (HPQ)https://www.hp.com\n- urlSuper Micro Computer (SMCI)https://www.supermicro.com\n- urlWestern Digital (WDC)https://www.westerndigital.com\n- urlSeagate Technology (STX)https://www.seagate.com\n\n---\n\n## 网络 / 通信设备\n\n- urlCisco Systems (CSCO)https://www.cisco.com\n- urlArista Networks (ANET)https://www.arista.com\n- urlJuniper Networks (JNPR)https://www.juniper.net\n- urlCorning (GLW)https://www.corning.com\n- urlCoherent (COHR)https://www.coherent.com\n\n---\n\n## 金融科技 / 支付\n\n- urlVisa (V)https://www.visa.com\n- urlMastercard (MA)https://www.mastercard.com\n- urlPayPal (PYPL)https://www.paypal.com\n- urlBlock (XYZ)https://www.block.xyz\n- urlFiserv (FI)https://www.fiserv.com\n\n---\n\n## 我认为如果做“美国科技核心 50～70 股池”，基本应该包含：\n\n### 超级核心（类似科技指数权重）\nAAPL、MSFT、NVDA、GOOGL、AMZN、META、AVGO、ORCL、AMD、TSLA\n\n### 第二梯队\nCRM、ADBE、NOW、INTU、PANW、CRWD、NFLX、CSCO、QCOM、TXN、ADI、AMAT、LRCX、MU、ANET\n\n### 新兴成长\nPLTR、CRWV、SNOW、MDB、DDOG、NET、SMCI、ABNB、UBER\n\n这套池子基本已经覆盖了美国科技市场的主要方向：\n- AI 算力\n- 半导体\n- 云计算\n- 企业软件\n- 网络安全\n- 网络设备\n- 数据中心\n- 消费互联网\n- 智能汽车\n- 金融科技\n\n规模大概 **60～70只左右**，已经接近一个“人工版美股科技指数”的覆盖范围。"
